      "body": "Decision record for #5815 (security binding review across adapters & relays), matching the sibling record precedent of PR #7613 (#5811) and PR #7653 (#5813).\n\n**Chosen shape:** all session security binds to the ID layer — origin signature, handshake transcript, and a local policy floor — never to the carrier.\n- Carrier-independent authenticity (TLS is additive, never load-bearing; #5674's rule given mechanism)\n- Transcript binding: negotiated version/carrier/relay-path/capabilities hashed into session key derivation + mutual confirmation\n- A non-negotiable security floor; adapters that cannot meet it are not offered\n- Replay protection per class: durable = idempotent origin-signed events; live = per-session sequence + MAC under transcript-derived keys; handshake/control = single-use nonces, signed expiring advertisements\n- Downgrade = classified security failure (`security_downgrade_refused` / `transcript_mismatch`), never a silent weaker retry\n- Relays cannot re-originate; purpose-separated domain labels for all signatures/MACs\n\nAlternatives rejected with reasons (carrier TLS, per-adapter bespoke rules, warned downgrade, global replay window, hop-by-hop relay termination), 8 testable invariants, interface obligations on #5809/#5791/#5810/#5814/#5795 stated explicitly, and an explicit statement that no #5674 parent decision changes.\n\nDoc-only change; no test suite applies (per task packet). Task 13769.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796774370&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7863&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7863&signature=5e2600d20d4b0ede55d70f0e04a0f4b019c0c09fcd64a9afe0986bdabca870da\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7863?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
